  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/76fd838349e2eefaa42871f42acce22810e9a64e.png\" alt=\"分隔條\">\n<strong>一款可愛的快捷欄，以青蛙和花朵為主題，專為 Frogcrafting 的 <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/frogcrafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitch</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@frogcrafting\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> 頻道設計！</strong></p><p>此資源包僅更改快捷欄，可與其他介面資源包搭配使用，只需確保將其載入在最上層即可。<br>\n請注意，1.20.1 及以下版本無法完全相容，因此在這些版本中，按鈕材質也已進行了修改。</p><p>此資源包已收錄於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fproject%252ffrogcraftings-hardcore-modpack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Frogcrafting 的極限模組包</a>，快來看看吧！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fcoolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"modrinth\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/coolbot100s/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/curseforge_vector.svg\" alt=\"curseforge\"></a>\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fcollection%252f146032%252fall-garden-gals-content%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s/Bouncy-Leaves/assets/76798835/0b2c0293-c2ab-4956-9055-70bc7d7141c5\" alt=\"Planet Minecraft\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/qxRVkGDjdJ\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/discord-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"discord\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/available/github_vector.svg\" alt=\"github\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/sponsors/coolbot100s\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/donate/generic-singular_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持我們\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://twitch.tv/frogcrafting\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3/assets/cozy-minimal/social/twitch-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"twitch-plural\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/asJUBbAC/images/3cfcedbc87c765817216b818f435d9535620f513.png\" alt=\"快捷欄展示\"></p>",
